{"unit_id":"yuwang__dsh-matt-flow#card-zh","repo":"yuwang/dsh-matt-flow","commit":"2af1c75428c594afb36ba5edbf3e70852ff75347","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Matt 工程流是面向 DSH Web 客户端的开发工作流预设，把需求推进为拷问、规范、任务、实现、评审和收尾六个阶段。它注册 flow_stage 工具管理阶段状态与前置条件，并提供 flow_ask 决策卡、flow_skills 技能状态工具、输入框阶段胶囊和阶段进度投影。流程可记录决策、规范和任务单，并要求逐阶段推进，适合希望有可追踪产物和阶段约束的功能开发。首次使用会在缺少技能时从 Matt Pocock 技能包安装到本机；需要 Node.js 与 npx。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:327-409","index.js:470-502","index.js:685-720","index.js:827-867","client.js:435-443"]}
{"unit_id":"yuwang__dsh-matt-flow#card-en","repo":"yuwang/dsh-matt-flow","commit":"2af1c75428c594afb36ba5edbf3e70852ff75347","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Matt Flow is a DSH Web preset for a six-stage feature workflow. Tools track phases and prerequisites, gather choices in decision cards, and report skill installation status; a composer chip shows progress. Missing skills are installed locally on first use. Node.js and npx are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:327-409","index.js:470-502","index.js:685-720","index.js:827-867","client.js:435-443"]}
