{"unit_id":"yuwang__dsh-matt-flow#feature-1","repo":"yuwang/dsh-matt-flow","commit":"2af1c75428c594afb36ba5edbf3e70852ff75347","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Matt 工程流的功能「阶段跟踪」：提供 flow_stage 工具查看或推进单个功能的阶段，按拷问、规范、任务、实现、评审、收尾逐级推进，并检查相应文件或说明是否满足前置条件。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:327-409"]}
{"unit_id":"yuwang__dsh-matt-flow#feature-2","repo":"yuwang/dsh-matt-flow","commit":"2af1c75428c594afb36ba5edbf3e70852ff75347","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Matt 工程流的功能「决策卡」：在拷问阶段用 flow_ask 向用户呈现可选答案和补充文字；每次可提交一到三道题，每题需有二到四个选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:415-453","index.js:470-502","client.js:435-438"]}
{"unit_id":"yuwang__dsh-matt-flow#feature-3","repo":"yuwang/dsh-matt-flow","commit":"2af1c75428c594afb36ba5edbf3e70852ff75347","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Matt 工程流的功能「流程进度界面」：输入框工具行显示当前阶段和进度，展开后可查看阶段条件；阶段工具结果投影到界面状态中。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:775-809","client.js:439-443"]}
{"unit_id":"yuwang__dsh-matt-flow#feature-4","repo":"yuwang/dsh-matt-flow","commit":"2af1c75428c594afb36ba5edbf3e70852ff75347","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Matt 工程流的功能「技能套件准备」：flow_skills 可查看技能套件安装状态并在需要时重试；预设启动时缺少必需技能会触发本机安装。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:685-720","index.js:827-867"]}
{"unit_id":"yuwang__dsh-matt-flow#caveat-1","repo":"yuwang/dsh-matt-flow","commit":"2af1c75428c594afb36ba5edbf3e70852ff75347","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Matt 工程流在缺少必需技能时会调用 npx 安装 Matt Pocock 技能套件到 ~/.agents/skills，并写入本机安装状态及临时日志；需要 Node.js、npx 和相应网络可用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:34-47","index.js:508-584","index.js:685-720"]}
